00:08:50.142 --> 00:08:50.975
- Oh my god.

00:08:50.975 --> 00:08:52.710
- So yeah, it was one of the
early votes of confidence

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:53.940
in my writing.

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:55.920
- Oh my god, that's
what I say in my world.

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:57.270
It's like, if you see someone sing

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.680
