- Yeah.

00:09:07.377 --> 00:09:09.990
And it's kind of the same
with like, people's kids too.

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:12.538
Like, sometimes you look at a
kid and you're like (gasping).

00:09:12.538 --> 00:09:14.017
(audience laughs)

